<title>HONG KONG: TVB says Dyke resigns as director.</title>
<headline>TVB says Dyke resigns as director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Television Broadcasts Ltd of Hong Kong said in a statement on Tuesday Gregory Dyke had resigned as a director with effect from February 27.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6590</p>
